                                                "text": "prenatal exposure"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "31a242d6-e2bb-497a-b25c-39ac25e957a5",
                                                "sense_id": "4b56e114-8d8d-3281-88cd-c25362510b95",
                                                "text": "If you check the fitnessy corners of Instagram, prenatal workouts are intense and impressive AF."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ec8c9f2a-1508-43ed-96d4-fce1bcce5ddb",
                                                "sense_id": "4b56e114-8d8d-3281-88cd-c25362510b95",
                                                "text": "At 9 months, the researchers found deficits in motor function in infants with prenatal exposure to naled."
